# GitHub Packages Registry Configuration
# =======================

# Set registry to GitHub Packages
@damarkuncoro:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com/

# Authentication
# -------------
# You need a GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT) with `read:packages` and `write:packages` scopes.
# 
# 1. Create a PAT at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# 2. Add it to your ~/.npmrc file:
#    //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=YOUR_GITHUB_PAT
#
# Or login using npm:
#   npm login --registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com/
